.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OSSL_CRMF_MSG_SET1_REGINFO_CERTREQ 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm OSSL_CRMF_MSG_get0_regInfo_utf8Pairs ,
.Nm OSSL_CRMF_MSG_set1_regInfo_utf8Pairs ,
.Nm OSSL_CRMF_MSG_get0_regInfo_certReq ,
.Nm OSSL_CRMF_MSG_set1_regInfo_certReq
.Nd functions getting or setting CRMF Registration Info
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/crmf.h
.Ft ASN1_UTF8STRING
     *
.Fo OSSL_CRMF_MSG_get0_regInfo_utf8Pairs
.Fa "const OSSL_CRMF_MSG *msg"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo OSSL_CRMF_MSG_set1_regInfo_utf8Pairs
.Fa "OSSL_CRMF_MSG *msg"
.Fa "const ASN1_UTF8STRING *utf8pairs"
.Fc
.Ft OSSL_CRMF_CERTREQUEST
     *
.Fo OSSL_CRMF_MSG_get0_regInfo_certReq
.Fa "const OSSL_CRMF_MSG *msg"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo OSSL_CRMF_MSG_set1_regInfo_certReq
.Fa "OSSL_CRMF_MSG *msg"
.Fa "const OSSL_CRMF_CERTREQUEST *cr"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn OSSL_CRMF_MSG_get0_regInfo_utf8Pairs
returns the first utf8Pairs regInfo in the given
.Fa msg ,
if present.
.Pp
.Fn OSSL_CRMF_MSG_set1_regInfo_utf8Pairs
adds a copy of the given
.Fa utf8pairs
value as utf8Pairs regInfo to the given
.Fa msg .
See RFC 4211 section 7.1.
.Pp
.Fn OSSL_CRMF_MSG_get0_regInfo_certReq
returns the first certReq regInfo in the given
.Fa msg ,
if present.
.Pp
.Fn OSSL_CRMF_MSG_set1_regInfo_certReq
adds a copy of the given
.Fa cr
value as certReq regInfo to the given
.Fa msg .
See RFC 4211 section 7.2.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
All
.Xr get0_* 3
functions return the respective pointer value, NULL if not present.
.Pp
All
.Xr set1_* 3
functions return 1 on success, 0 on error.
.Sh NOTES
Calling the
.Xr set1_* 3
functions multiple times adds multiple instances of the respective
control to the regInfo structure of the given
.Fa msg .
While RFC 4211 expects multiple utf8Pairs in one regInfo structure, it
does not allow multiple certReq.
.Sh SEE ALSO
RFC 4211
.Sh HISTORY
The OpenSSL CRMF support was added in OpenSSL 3.0.
